[2026-01-30T15:22:54.374Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Execute this requirement immediately without asking questions.\n\n## REQUIREMENT\n\n# Remove redundant confidence calculation in OverviewTab\n\n## Metadata\n- **Category**: code_quality\n- **Effort**: Unknown (N/A/3)\n- **Impact**: Unknown (N/A/3)\n- **Scan Type**: pragmatic_integrator\n- **Generated**: 1/30/2026, 1:29:40 AM\n\n## Description\nOverviewTab calculates highConf, medConf, lowConf (lines 31-36) but stats already contains highConfidence and avgConfidence. Either remove the local calculation if stats provides enough data, or ensure stats provides distribution data upstream to avoid recalculating in the component.\n\n## Reasoning\nRecalculating confidence distribution that could be computed once upstream wastes CPU cycles and creates potential for inconsistency between stats.highConfidence and local highConf values.\n\n## Context\n\n**Note**: This section provides supporting architectural documentation and is NOT a hard requirement. Use it as guidance to understand existing code structure and maintain consistency.\n\n### Context: Report Tabs\n\n**Description**: Tab-based navigation components for quick-access report sections. Provides compact, scannable summaries for overview, findings, sources, entities, analysis, and perspectives.\n**Related Files**:\n- `src/components/report/tabs/OverviewTab.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/tabs/FindingsTab.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/tabs/SourcesTab.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/tabs/EntitiesTab.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/tabs/AnalysisTab.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/tabs/PerspectivesTab.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/tabs/index.tsx`\n\n**Post-Implementation**: After completing this requirement, evaluate if the context description or file paths need updates. Use the appropriate API/DB query to update the context if architectural changes were made.\n\n## Recommended Skills\n\n- **compact-ui-design**: Use 